    "concept": {
      "title": "紅葉が星になる",
      "story": "夕方の裏山の広場で、6 匹と並んで座る。一本の木から紅葉の光が一枚離れ、旋律に合わせて左右の木から一枚ずつ舞う。葉は流れになってゆるい渦を昇り、上ほど色が冷え、和声が開く瞬間に白い星の点へ変わって夜空に広がる。星が残って瞬く中、最後の一枚が同じ木から犬のそばに降りて消える。",
      "palette": "primary #FF6A2B (momiji red) / secondary #FFB347 (gold) / cool #B8B4FF (the cooled top of the vortex) / accent #F4F8FF (star white). Colour-changing layers are tint:false.",
      "motifs": [
        "M1 one leaf",
        "M2 leaf per melody note / answer from the other tree",
        "M3 rising vortex that cools with height",
        "M4 leaves become star points (one big scatter)",
        "M5 stars remain, last leaf by the dogs"
      ],
      "arc": "one leaf → leaves answer each other → vortex → leaves become stars → night stars + the last leaf",
      "avoid": "constellation lines / dipper (kd-quiet-wishes), light flowers / light tree (garden-lights), sakura petals (petal-waltz), paw prints (happy-tails), screen-filling particles, explosions, constant maximum"
    },
